      <div class="cv-title">
        Associate Researcher<br />
        College of Agriculture and Biotechnology / The Rural Development Academy Agricultural Research Station<br />
        Deputy Director, Center for Digital Intelligence in Specialty Crops<br />
        <span style="font-size:12.5px;color:#6b7280">Zhejiang University, Hangzhou, China</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-contact">
        ✉ <a href="mailto:fruit@zju.edu.cn">fruit@zju.edu.cn</a>
        🌐 <a href="https://wyzju.com" target="_blank">wyzju.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="s-title">Research Interests</div>
  <div class="rd-grid">
    <div class="rd-item">
      <h3>Biosynthesis &amp; Varietal Evolution of Citrus Flavonoids</h3>
      Focusing on citrus flavonoids (polymethoxyflavones and flavanones) and coumarins, we characterize key biosynthetic enzyme genes — elucidating substrate specificity and catalytic mechanisms — and construct complete pathway maps from gene to metabolite. Integrated genomic–metabolomic analyses further reveal the evolutionary basis of bioactive compound divergence shaped by long-term citrus domestication and varietal differentiation; representative work published in <em>Molecular Plant</em> (IF 32.7).
    </div>
    <div class="rd-item">
      <h3>Health Effects &amp; Molecular Targets of Polymethoxyflavones</h3>
      Focusing on polymethoxyflavones (PMFs), we systematically investigate the molecular basis of their antioxidant, anti-inflammatory, and anti-tumor activities. A key discovery is that PMFs stabilize NRF2 by suppressing CUL3-mediated ubiquitination and proteasomal degradation, revealing a novel mechanism by which flavonoids activate antioxidant defense. Further work demonstrates that PMFs exert anti-inflammatory effects via JAK2/STAT3 and NLRP3 signaling, and induce tumor cell apoptosis by upregulating RARβ — with these mechanisms shown to operate broadly across diverse flavonoids.
    </div>
    <div class="rd-item">
      <h3>Endophyte-Driven Nutritional &amp; Flavor Quality of Citrus</h3>
      Investigating how endophytic microbial communities regulate both citrus flavonoid accumulation (nutritional quality) and volatile organic compound (VOC) production (flavor quality), with nutrition and flavor as dual guiding objectives. We characterize endophyte diversity and host-interaction patterns, study oxidative stress responses during endophyte-mediated fermentation, and establish standardized protocols for endophyte isolation, identification, and cryopreservation.
    </div>
    <div class="rd-item">
      <h3>AI Databases &amp; Intelligent Agents for Agricultural Research</h3>
      Building structured databases and knowledge graphs tailored to plant metabolomics, genomics, and agricultural science. We explore large language model (LLM) applications for automated literature curation, multi-omics data mining, and research decision support, developing intelligent agent tools to advance AI-driven agricultural innovation.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="s-title">Education</div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2015.09 – 2020.06</span><span class="body">Zhejiang University · Pomology · <strong>Ph.D.</strong> (Supervisor: Prof. Chongde Sun)</span></div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2011.09 – 2015.06</span><span class="body">Zhejiang University · Horticulture · <strong>B.S.</strong></span></div>

  <div class="s-title">Work Experience</div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2024.03 – present</span><span class="body">Zhejiang University · New Rural Development Research Institute · Interdisciplinary Research Platform</span></div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2023.01 – present</span><span class="body">Zhejiang University · Fruit Research Institute · <strong>Associate Researcher</strong></span></div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2020.07 – 2024.02</span><span class="body">Zhejiang University · Fruit Research Institute · <strong>Postdoctoral Researcher</strong> (Supervisor: Prof. Chongde Sun)</span></div>

  <div class="s-title">Honors & Awards</div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2023</span><span class="body"><strong>First Prize, Ministry of Education Science and Technology Progress Award</strong> (Key Contributor)</span></div>
  <div class="item"><span class="year">2024.11</span><span class="body"><strong>Best Presentation Award</strong>, 2nd Agricultural Food Young Scientists Academic Salon, Jinan, Shandong</span></div>

  <div class="s-title">Research Metrics</div>
